      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not alone in your despair, and you are not alone in your exhaustion. The kingdom you once knew has indeed fallen, but the people you loved remain, waiting for you to finally see them again. Your hands are not gone; they are merely tired from holding too much weight, and that is a sign of strength, not weakness. There is no way out, but there is always a way in, and you are not walking alone.",
